# Expectation record for 08_gcc_extensions/002_typeof.c
#
# Reproduce one cell by hand with no harness: render the three command templates
# below, substituting the target triple, the optimization level, the source path,
# the output path, and the target's runner (empty on the natively executing target).

program            = 002_typeof
area               = 08_gcc_extensions
description        = typeof and __typeof__ applied to expressions and used in declarations
targets            = x86_64, i686, aarch64, riscv64
opt_levels         = -O0, -O1, -O2
shared_flags       = -static
bcc_command        = $BCC --target <triple> <opt> -static <src> -o <out>
ref_command        = $REF_CC_<TRIPLE> <opt> -static <src> -o <out>
run_command        = <runner> <out>
expect_exit        = 0
oracle_a           = enabled
oracle_b           = enabled
oracle_c           = enabled
ub_audit_flags     = -Wall -Wextra -Wconversion -Wsign-conversion -Wshadow -Werror
ub_notes           <<END
Every object declared through typeof is assigned before it is read.  The operand of typeof
is not evaluated, so no side effect is duplicated or lost by it.  Each swap and sum stays
inside the range of the deduced type, so no signed overflow occurs, and the rank probes
report a type without depending on any width that varies by target.
Every property is computed twice, once from literal constants and once from
volatile-qualified storage, so the constant folder's answer cannot stand in for the
one the backend computes at run time.
No header is included and printf is declared by hand, so nothing here depends on a
standard-library header bcc does not ship.
END
impl_defined_notes <<END
The warning gate drops -pedantic for this program.  The subject under test is a GCC
extension, which is by definition not standard C, and -pedantic exists precisely to reject
such constructs: with it in force the program could not be compiled at all and the feature
would go untested, which constraint C3 forbids.  Every other member of the gate is
retained, including -Werror, so no other class of defect in this program is downgraded.
END
expected_stdout    <<END
to_folded_b=2
to_folded_c=42
to_folded_d=100
to_folded_unsigned=15
to_folded_deref=40
to_folded_elem=41
to_folded_add=42
to_folded_swap=22 11
to_same_as_int=1
to_same_as_ptr=1
to_long_rank=1
to_unsigned_rank=1
to_runtime_c=42
to_runtime_d=80
to_runtime_unsigned=15
to_runtime_add=42
to_runtime_swap=22 11
END
